### Create a new entity
POST http://localhost:8090/restapi/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "task": "Test Rest APi Endpoints",
  "done": "false"

}

### GET All entity from REST API endpoint
GET http://localhost:8090/restapi/todos

### GET One entity from REST API endpoint
GET http://localhost:8090/restapi/todos/4

### UPDATE entity at the REST API endpoint - will replace all properties with the properties in the request body
PUT http://localhost:8090/restapi/todos/4
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": 4,
  "task": "updated",
  "done": "true"

}

### DELETE entity at the REST API endpoint
DELETE http://localhost:8090/restapi/todos/4

### Update specific properties of the entity at the REST API endpoint
PATCH http://localhost:8090/restapi/todos/primaryKeyValue
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "propertyName": "propertyValue"
}